345
00:15:36,780 --> 00:15:39,700
里奇 你是怎么来这里的
Oh, Richie! How did you get here?

346
00:15:40,100 --> 00:15:41,700
我以为你要工作呢
I thought you had to work.

347
00:15:41,880 --> 00:15:43,400
不是说演戏不算工作
Not that acting isn't work.

348
00:15:43,400 --> 00:15:45,840
不信问问我的悲剧演员同事 娜塔莉·波特曼
Just ask my fellow thespian, Natalie Portman.

349
00:15:46,380 --> 00:15:48,480
你穿上这衣服就一整个悲剧
You look like a thespian in that shirt.

350
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:50,940
说来好笑 我其实是坐
Funny story: I actually got here

351
00:15:50,940 --> 00:15:52,740
"关你屁事"快线过来的
on the None of Your Beeswax Express.

352
00:15:53,860 --> 00:15:54,700
他又玩这个哏了
He did it again.

353
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:56,300
事实证明 怎么玩都不会腻
Turns out it doesn't get old.

354
00:15:58,420 --> 00:16:00,960
好了 僵尸们 还有三分钟开拍
Okay, zombies. Three minutes till we shoot.

355
00:16:01,280 --> 00:16:03,000
让我见识一下你们的蠕动和呻吟
Let me see you wriggle and moan.

356
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:09,360
邦妮 我呻吟是因为
Bonnie, am I moaning because I am horrified

357
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,580
我对变成僵尸感到恐惧
at what I've become?

358
00:16:10,580 --> 00:16:13,560
还是因为我被挂在肉钩上 所以痛苦地呻吟
Or because I'm in pain from hanging on this meat hook?

359
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:17,720
她肯定是去问导演了
She must be going to ask the director.

360
00:16:18,380 --> 00:16:20,440
兰迪来了 我看起来怎么样
Here comes Randy. How do I look?

361
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:23,020
像一坨烂肉
Like a piece of meat.

362
00:16:23,780 --> 00:16:24,820
就当你是赞美了
I'll take it.

363
00:16:26,548 --> 00:16:29,000
你上一场戏太滑稽了
You were hilarious in that last scene.

364
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:30,920
我觉得大家一定很开心他们没有请艾迪·墨菲
I think everybody's really happy they didn't get Eddie Murphy.

365
00:16:31,540 --> 00:16:32,420
艾迪·墨菲
Eddie Murphy?

366
00:16:33,100 --> 00:16:36,120
我当时就好奇 为什么我吃饭时非得演我全家人
I was wondering why I had to play my whole family at dinner.

367
00:16:40,180 --> 00:16:41,660
这是喜剧片吗
This is a comedy?

368
00:16:42,520 --> 00:16:44,640
幸好我是全能型演技派
Well, it's a good thing I'm so versatile.

369
00:16:45,140 --> 00:16:46,940
我可以变身笨拙搞笑版吉尔
I think I'll make Jill clumsy.

370
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:49,480
他们去哪儿了
Ugh! Where'd they go?

371
00:16:50,740 --> 00:16:53,320
冥想让我改头换面
Yeah, meditation has totally changed me.

372
00:16:53,620 --> 00:16:54,460
我不再易怒
I'm not as angry.

373
00:16:54,920 --> 00:16:56,240
不准看我
Hey! Don't look at me!

374
00:16:58,060 --> 00:16:59,560
是啊 你看起来平静多了
Yeah, you do seem calmer.

375
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:02,340
真好奇他们为什么要求你的律师必须陪你拍戏
I wonder why they demanded your lawyer be on set.

376
00:17:02,340 --> 00:17:04,580
兄弟 等我们回洛城
Dude, when we get back to LA,

377
00:17:04,580 --> 00:17:06,240
我帮你介绍个妹子
there's someone I want to set you up with.

378
00:17:06,380 --> 00:17:08,260
我得听听这事 快推我
Oh... I need to hear this. Push me.

379
00:17:09,120 --> 00:17:12,080
她是个辣妹 可我现在不跟
She's hot. But I'm just not dating anyone

380
00:17:12,080 --> 00:17:13,540
开混合动力车的妹子约会
who drives a Prius right now.

381
00:17:13,860 --> 00:17:14,900
我不知道
I don't know.

382
00:17:15,460 --> 00:17:17,340
我现在处境奇怪
I'm in a weird place right now,

383
00:17:17,380 --> 00:17:18,640
我不是说身处德州这地方
and I don't just mean Texas.

384
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:21,480
你不会还在跟纽约那妹子约会吧
You're not still seeing that girl in New York, are you?

385
00:17:22,420 --> 00:17:24,120
纽约哪个妹子
What girl in New York?

386
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:25,640
我啊
Me!

387
00:17:26,540 --> 00:17:28,100
你的脑子是被吃了吗
Did your brain get eaten already,

388
00:17:28,100 --> 00:17:29,240
还是吉尔就是个蠢货
or is Jill just an idiot?

389
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:31,460
吉尔只是生活压力太大
She is just overwhelmed.

390
00:17:31,620 --> 00:17:33,360
她有三个不满五岁的孩子
She has three kids under the age of five

391
00:17:33,360 --> 00:17:34,580
车子还有问题
and car trouble.

392
00:17:35,800 --> 00:17:36,860
我们分手了
We broke up.

393
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:38,740
我们总是视频
We were Facetiming so much

394
00:17:38,780 --> 00:17:40,220
感觉就像跟自己手机约会
I felt like I was dating my iPhone.

395
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:42,700
有晚在餐厅吃饭 我和手机分食了一道开胃菜
The other night at dinner, we split an appetizer.

396
00:17:45,080 --> 00:17:45,640
快装死
Play dead!

397
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:49,200
没错 麦克斯是超级棒
Yeah, Max is incredible,

398
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:51,440
但我们现在天各一方
but we're just in different places right now.

399
00:17:52,220 --> 00:17:53,460
屁 才不是
No, you're not.

400
00:17:57,300 --> 00:17:59,060
我也希望我能说异地恋
I wish I could say the long distance thing

401
00:17:59,060 --> 00:18:00,100
对我来说足够了
was gonna be enough for me,

402
00:18:00,100 --> 00:18:02,620
但其实不然...永远都不会够
but it wasn't... it wasn't ever gonna be.

403
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:03,840
恋爱哪有够的时候
It just can't be enough.

404
00:18:04,340 --> 00:18:05,960
就像你喜欢听到关于你发型的赞美
Like you with compliments about your hair.

405
00:18:07,220 --> 00:18:08,400
你喜欢我的发型 对吧
You like it, though, right?

406
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:11,980
我用尽一切努力想忘掉她
You know, I'm doing everything I can to get over her.

407
00:18:13,140 --> 00:18:15,760
手机屏蔽她的电话 去做心理咨询
Blocked her on my phone, went to therapy,

408
00:18:15,900 --> 00:18:18,200
看了整整13季《实习医生格蕾》
watched all 13 seasons of Grey's Anatomy,

409
00:18:18,300 --> 00:18:21,520
结果意识到我只看了一集的20分钟而已
then realized I'd only watched 20 minutes of one episode.

410
00:18:22,520 --> 00:18:24,820
所以我的发型到底好不好
So, yes or no on my hair?

411
00:18:25,540 --> 00:18:26,340
很赞
It's great.

412
00:18:27,060 --> 00:18:29,720
但我还没准备好去见那个开混合动力车的妹子
But I'm not ready to meet that girl with the Prius just yet.

413
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:32,160
的确 我很赞成省油的观念
I mean, I'm all for good gas mileage.

414
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:35,000
但现在还不行
Just not yet.

415
00:18:36,500 --> 00:18:38,960
我懂了 你现在喜欢男人了
I get it. You're gay now.

416
00:18:39,460 --> 00:18:40,720
我倒想呢
I wish!

417
00:18:57,820 --> 00:19:00,180
好了 还有两分钟 各位
All right, two minutes, everybody.

418
00:19:00,380 --> 00:19:03,940
咱们争取一次过 因为这部电影烂死了
Let's do this thing quick, 'cause this movie sucks.

419
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:06,860
麦克斯 你刚才为什么不说话
Max, why didn't you say something?

420
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:07,620
那可是你的大好机会
That was your chance.

421
00:19:08,820 --> 00:19:11,200
你也听见他对那个假警长说什么了
Ugh, you heard what he said to that fake sheriff.

422
00:19:11,940 --> 00:19:13,780
他无法满足于异地恋
The long distance thing isn't enough for him,

423
00:19:13,780 --> 00:19:15,020
他需要重新开始
and he needs to move on.

424
00:19:15,220 --> 00:19:16,880
我不应该阻止他
It's only fair that I let him.

425
00:19:17,440 --> 00:19:19,800
叫我傻货吧 我是个浪漫主义者
Call me stupid for being a romantic

426
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:21,720
相信爱能战胜一切
and thinking love could conquer all.

427
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:22,300
傻货
Stupid!

428
00:19:26,700 --> 00:19:28,160
很遗憾 麦克斯
I'm sorry, Max.

429
00:19:30,340 --> 00:19:31,400
你在干嘛
What are you doing?

430
00:19:32,100 --> 00:19:33,020
你想尿尿吗
Do you have to pee?

431
00:19:33,820 --> 00:19:35,680
因为我发现如果你先尿一点在裤子里
Because I find if you go in your pants a little

432
00:19:35,680 --> 00:19:36,860
然后再尿一点 再一点
and then a little and then a little,

433
00:19:36,860 --> 00:19:37,760
就完全不会那么明显
it's not that noticeable.

434
00:19:38,380 --> 00:19:39,960
我是想给你一个拥抱啦
I was gonna give you a hug.

435
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:42,340
好吧 来抱吧
All right, bring it in.

436
00:19:50,340 --> 00:19:53,280
-你没事吧 -有事
- You okay? - No.

437
00:19:53,280 --> 00:19:55,300
我这段感情彻底没戏了
My relationship is really over,

438
00:19:55,300 --> 00:19:57,778
而且我下面快失去知觉了
and I'm starting to lose feeling in my downstairs.

439
00:19:57,778 --> 00:19:59,262
是啊
Yeah.

440
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:01,260
很抱歉拽着你跑了大半个国家
Ugh. I'm sorry I dragged you across the country.

441
00:20:02,120 --> 00:20:05,160
不是你拽着我 是我想陪着你
You didn't drag me anywhere. I wanted to be here with you.

442
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:07,340
我们回家吧 麦克斯
Let's go home, Max.

443
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:08,980
我会告诉邦妮我们不演了
I'll tell Bonnie we're quitting.

444
00:20:08,980 --> 00:20:11,280
我们就跟媒体说 因精疲力竭而退出
and we'll tell the press it was exhaustion.

445
00:20:11,560 --> 00:20:13,500
不 我们哪儿不去
No. We're not going anywhere yet.

446
00:20:13,500 --> 00:20:15,440
我们好不容易来到这 至少其中一人
We came all this way. At least one of us should

447
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:16,116
应该得到自己想要的
get what they want.

448
00:20:16,116 --> 00:20:18,563
你一定要演成这部电影
You are gonna be in this movie.

449
00:20:19,460 --> 00:20:20,080
麦克斯
Max!

450
00:20:20,820 --> 00:20:23,240
等我成了巨星后 我不会忘了你
I won't forget about you when I'm big.

451
00:20:23,700 --> 00:20:25,820
虽然我绝对会因此而少联系
I mean, I'll definitely see you less.

452
00:20:27,340 --> 00:20:29,580
什么意思 不要那个金发妞僵尸是吗
What's that? Get rid of the blonde zombie?

453
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:30,260
上帝有眼
Oh, thank God.

454
00:20:30,820 --> 00:20:32,259
什么 为什么
What? Why?

455
00:20:32,259 --> 00:20:34,793
因为我的呻吟声吗
Was it my "Mow, mow, mow, mow"?

456
00:20:34,860 --> 00:20:37,940
邦妮 等等 我还能创作呢
Bonnie, wait. I... I can also write.

457
00:20:37,940 --> 00:20:39,080
听听这句台词
Check this line out:

458
00:20:39,980 --> 00:20:41,260
"见到你很鸡冻"
"Freezed to meet you."

459
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:45,600
把我也放下来吧 邦邦 我们俩分不开
Cut me down, Bon Bon. You can't split us up.

460
00:20:45,760 --> 00:20:46,760
相信我 我试过了
Believe me. I've tried.
